	(text "Power rails (CORE-007, 009). SW101 drives the 3.0 V LDO enable: OFF leaves only charger + fuel gauge (< 10 uA).\nV5 = VBUS when USB is present (TPS2116 priority, switches to boost below 4.0 V), else TPS61023 boost (5.07 V, enabled by MCU).\nLED_5V: AP22653 limits the switch-board LED rail to 1.7 A and cuts it to 0 uA when LED_EN is low. MCU enables default low (pull-downs)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a4f9ede2-052d-5da9-8715-bde0bfea5895")
	)
